    {
      "text": "The high priest was privileged to use the Urim and Thummim (Num. 27:21), and we read of it during Saul’s time but not afterward. It was apparently missing, but its restoration was hoped for during the time of the second temple (Ezra 2:63).",
      "references": [
        {
